  "sourceTitle": "Authentic New Mexican Salsa",
  "sourceText": "Authentic New Mexican Salsa\nBy: Kevin Tu\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 gal Whole peeled tomatoes\n1 lrg Onion, chopped\n1 tablespoon Garlic, granulated\n1 tablespoon Salt\n1 1/2 pounds Fresh jalapenos\n1/2 cup Chile pequin\n1 ounce Fresh cilantro\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients. Let marinate for several hours. Enjoy.",
